#created by Duel Circuit - Runick Spright (2022)
#era 2022
#tier Tier 1 hybrid
#about Joined Spright’s Level 2 consistency with Runick Quick-Play Spells and Fountain to gain cards, disrupt actions and banish the opponent’s Deck.
